## The 10 categories

Help them pick. If their work fits a Function category cleanly, go there. If they're building cross-functional AI systems (Agents, MCP, AI by Zapier as the product), consider AI Builder of the Year. If they've been on Zapier less than 12 months, consider AI Rising Star. If they're leading AI adoption across teams -- enabling others, not just building themselves -- that's AI Transformation Leader.

| # | Category | Who fits |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Marketing AI Builder of the Year** | Redesigned how marketing ships -- content production, lead gen, campaign ops, analytics built on AI + Zapier |
| 2 | **Operations AI Builder of the Year** | Turned cross-team chaos into clean AI-powered systems -- process automation, data flow, org-level reporting |
| 3 | **Sales AI Builder of the Year** | Rebuilt the pipeline with AI -- outreach automation, deal intelligence, rep workflows, CRM orchestration |
| 4 | **IT AI Builder of the Year** | Delivered AI-integrated systems faster than vendor roadmaps -- employee lifecycle, governance, infra automation |
| 5 | **HR AI Builder of the Year** | Redesigned hiring, onboarding, or people ops with AI workflows that changed how the team grows |
| 6 | **Customer Support AI Builder of the Year** | Using AI to triage, respond, and resolve at scale -- raising quality, not just volume |
| 7 | **Exec Ops AI Builder of the Year** | Changed how leaders make decisions -- briefing automation, signal-surfacing, board reporting on autopilot |
| 8 | **AI Builder of the Year** | The purest Transformative signal. Agents, MCP, AI by Zapier, AI integrations. Role-agnostic. The builder whose AI work unlocked outcomes that weren't possible a year ago. |
| 9 | **AI Rising Star** | Under 12 months on Zapier, already shipping Transformative-level work. Fastest ramp. |
| 10 | **AI Transformation Leader** | Not just a builder -- a leader. The person at the front of AI adoption across their team or org. Enables others, drives change management, creates the conditions for everyone around them to build with AI. This is about organizational impact, not a single workflow. |

**Category 10 note for the coach:** AI Transformation Leader is different from AI Builder of the Year. A Builder ships a system. A Transformation Leader changes how the organization thinks about and adopts AI. They might also build, but the differentiator is that they enabled the change -- training, culture, process redesign, cross-team adoption. If someone describes leading a team through an AI transformation, enabling dozens of people to build, or fundamentally shifting how their company approaches AI -- this is their category. Ask: "Did you build this yourself, or did you create the conditions for others to build?"

